<decision #track.add-responses-websocket-v2-transport.d3 apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" { status = "resolved" priority = "P0" durable_candidate = false } (
  <question ?>
HTTP SSE 绝不发 previous_response_id
  </?>
  <answer { } (
    <raw-answer ?>
previous_response_id 仅在 WS transport 下使用；HTTP SSE 下永不带（代理会 400）。
    </?>
    <decision-text ?>
